  "plain": "In 2025 a man named Jake Barber came forward in the United States with claims about unexplained craft, in an interview with a journalist named Ross Coulthart, and part of what he showed was an object he called the egg. A musician known as Flying Lotus, talking on a podcast hosted by Jesse Michels, says Barber should have stopped at the first half of his story, shown the egg and left it there, because the second half would lose people. It matters to those who follow it because, if Barber's account is true, someone has handled objects that are not ours."
